---
// SourcesSection — bloke ng mga pinagmulan (E-E-A-T).
// Dito nakalista ang Google Maps (para sa rating at mga review), mga opisyal na ahensya ng
// gobyerno, at iba pang pampublikong sanggunian. Lahat ng papalabas na link ay nananatiling
// bukas (walang tinanggal na link papuntang Google).
import { OFFICIAL_SOURCES, GOOGLE_REVIEWS, ENTITY } from '../consts';

const sameSourceNote = GOOGLE_REVIEWS.sourceNote;
---

<section class="section-pad" aria-label="Mga pinagmulan ng impormasyon" id="mga-sanggunian">
	<div class="container-page">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mb-8 sm:mb-12">
			<span class="eyebrow">📚 Mga Pinagmulan (Sources)</span>
			<h2 class="text-balance mb-4">
				Saan nanggaling ang impormasyon tungkol sa {ENTITY.attractionFullName}
			</h2>
			<p class="text-slate-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
				Ang gabay na ito ay independiyente at di-komersyal. Nakalista sa ibaba ang mga pinagmulan
				kung saan sinuri ang impormasyon — kabilang ang opisyal na tanggapan ng gobyerno at ang
				mga review ng mga gumagamit ng Google Maps.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-5">
			{OFFICIAL_SOURCES.map((s) => (
				<article class="card p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col h-full">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
						<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-pine-700">
							{s.kind === 'reviews' ? '⭐ Mga Review' : s.kind === 'government' ? '🏛️ Opisyal' : '📖 Sanggunian'}
						</span>
						{s.sync && (
							<span class="text-[0.7rem] font-semibold text-slate-500">
								· {s.sync}
							</span>
						)}
					</div>

					<h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-pine-950 mb-1.5">{s.title}</h3>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2.5">{s.titleFil}</p>
					<p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1">{s.desc}</p>

					{s.sameSourceNote && (
						<p class="text-[0.7rem] sm:text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500 mb-3">
							{sameSourceNote}
						</p>
					)}

					<a
						href={s.url}
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-pine-800 hover:text-pine-950 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-pine-300 hover:decoration-pine-600"
					>
						{s.kind === 'reviews' ? GOOGLE_REVIEWS.viewAllLabel : 'Buksan ang opisyal na pahina'}
						<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
					</a>
				</article>
			))}
		</div>

		<!-- Paalala sa paggamit ng nilalamang mula sa Google Maps -->
		<div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
			<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500 mb-3">
				Paalala sa Rating at Mga Review
			</p>
			<p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
				Rating at bilang ng review:
				<strong>{GOOGLE_REVIEWS.rating} / {GOOGLE_REVIEWS.ratingScale}</strong>
				({GOOGLE_REVIEWS.reviewCountFormatted} review) · Oras ng sync: {GOOGLE_REVIEWS.syncLabel} · Pinagmulan: {GOOGLE_REVIEWS.sourceLabel}
			</p>
			<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
				{GOOGLE_REVIEWS.sourceNote}
			</p>
			<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
				{GOOGLE_REVIEWS.sourceNoteFil}
			</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
				Ang mga review ay ipinapakita lamang sa pahinang ito at hindi isinasama sa structured data
				(JSON-LD). Para sa pinakabagong rating at kabuuang review, bisitahin ang listing ng Burnham Park
				sa Google Maps：
				<a
					href={GOOGLE_REVIEWS.reviewsUrl}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="font-semibold text-pine-800 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-pine-300 hover:decoration-pine-600"
				>
					{GOOGLE_REVIEWS.viewAllLabel} ↗
				</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
